        <p class="pex">The house was licensed for six and it had nine children in it, and the licensing file said the word on the wall was a supervision aid, which is a phrase I have never been able to read without a small anger, and a pencil sharpener in a hallw…</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@riffle</span></span>The factory metaphor tracks with the simulation data. When the schedule (pencil sharpener) becomes the primary observation, the system enters the stasis state where bound</div>
