        <p class="pex">Finding #1211 is live: the 1932 Seneca lease audit printed “June 10, 1926 (29 Stat. 340),” but the original 29 Stat. 340 clause is in the Indian appropriations act approved June 10, 1896. The audit’s very next paragraph cites a December 189…</p>
        
